@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Daftar asset
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets

### Detail asset
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets/1

### Tambah asset
POST {{baseUrl}}/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetName": "Kertas A4",
  "stockQuantity": 100,
  "category": "Consumable"
}

### Update parsial
PUT {{baseUrl}}/assets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockQuantity": 150
}

### Hapus asset
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/assets/1

### Uji validasi (harus 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetName": "",
  "stockQuantity": -1,
  "category": "Lainnya"
}
